{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2222","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Seek the Truth"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M-IayQIR0XA"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Nanatsukaze - Connect the World"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is an interactive problem."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are two hidden integers $$$k$$$ and $$$c$$$ such that $$$k\\in \\{1,2,3\\}$$$ and $$$1\\le c\\le 2^n-1$$$. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that $$$c\\neq 0$$$."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Before any interaction, you need to tell the jury a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"non-negative"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integer $$$a\\le 2^n-1$$$. The grader will then use $$$a$$$ as the initial element in the set $$$S$$$, that is, initially $$$S = \\{a\\}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next, you can make at most $$$n+3$$$ queries of the following two types:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Select an integer $$$x$$$ such that $$$0\\leq x\\le 2^n-1$$$. The jury will insert $$$f(x)$$$ into $$$S$$$ and then respond with $$$|S|$$$ (i. e., the size of $$$S$$$ after the insertion); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Select an integer $$$y$$$ such that $$$0\\leq y\\le 2^n-1$$$. The jury will respond with the number of integers $$$z$$$ such that $$$z\\in S$$$ and $$$z\\geq y$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The definition of $$$f(x)$$$ is as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$ f(x)= \\begin{cases} x\\,\\&\\,c & \\text{if}\\, k=1,\\\\ x\\,|\\,c & \\text{if}\\, k=2,\\\\ x\\oplus c & \\text{if}\\, k=3.\\\\ \\end{cases} $$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here, $$$\\&$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#AND"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise AND operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", $$$|$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#OR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise OR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", and $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to determine the values of $$$k$$$ and $$$c$$$ using at most $$$n+3$$$ interactions."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please note that reporting the answer does not count towards the $$$n+3$$$ interactions."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\leq n \\leq 60$$$). Then, interaction follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"custom","title":"Interaction"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Interaction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"First, you need to output an integer $$$a$$$ ($$$0\\leq a\\le 2^n-1$$$) — the initial element you chose for set $$$S$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To make an interaction, output a single line in the following format:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\mathtt{I}\\;x$$$ ($$$0\\leq x\\le 2^n-1$$$) — Insert $$$f(x)$$$ into set $$$S$$$. After that, the jury will return $$$|S|$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\mathtt{Q}\\;y$$$ ($$$0\\leq y\\le 2^n-1$$$) — Query how many $$$z$$$-s in set $$$S$$$ satisfy $$$z \\geq y$$$. The jury will return the count of such $$$z$$$-s."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To give the final answer, output a single line in the following format:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\mathtt{A}\\;k\\;c$$$ ($$$1\\leq k\\le 3$$$, $$$1\\leq c\\le 2^n-1$$$) — the values of $$$k$$$ and $$$c$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After printing each query do not forget to output the end of line and flush$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$ the output. Otherwise, you will get "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idleness limit exceeded"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" verdict."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If, at any interaction step, you read $$$-1$$$ instead of valid data, your solution must exit immediately. This means that your solution will receive "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wrong answer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" because of an invalid query or any other mistake. Failing to exit can result in an arbitrary verdict because your solution will continue to read from a closed stream. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that the grader is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"non-adaptive"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". This means that the values of $$$k$$$ and $$$c$$$ are fixed at the beginning and will not change based on your interactions."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hacks"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To hack, use the following format."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line should contain a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of each test case should contain three integers $$$n$$$, $$$k$$$, and $$$c$$$ ($$$2 \\leq n \\leq 60$$$, $$$1\\leq k\\le 3$$$, $$$1\\leq c\\le 2^n-1$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases should not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$To flush, use: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fflush(stdout)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in C++; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"sys.stdout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Python; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" see the documentation for other languages. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n2\n\n\n1\n\n2\n\n\n2\n\n1\n\n2\n\n2\n\n3\n\n2\n\n\n2\n\n2\n\n2"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n\n\n3\nI 3\n\nA 1 3\n\n1\nI 0\n\nQ 2\n\nQ 1\n\nQ 0\n\nI 3\n\nA 2 2\n\n1\nI 1\n\nI 0\n\nA 3 1"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Below is the interaction process in the example:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Solution"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Jury"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Explanation"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$3$$$ test cases."}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"a